Enhancement: Speed up `--exclude-file` and `--include-file` with many patterns

The `backup`, `restore` and `rewrite` commands compared every file against
each exclude and include pattern. With thousands of patterns, for example an
exclude file that lists all files installed by the package manager, this was
extremely slow.

Restic now looks up patterns without wildcards in an index, so the time needed
to check them no longer grows with their number. For example, a backup with an
exclude file of 100000 plain paths is now about 25 times faster.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/2694
